{"h:\\Antigravity\\Ahoy Matey\\Wayfinder_Sourcebook\\03_Races_and_Transformations.md": [{"StartLine": 13, "EndLine": 13, "TargetContent": "- **Tideborn Amphibious Nature:** Ignores underwater movement penalties and natural ocean terrain penalties. Can breathe underwater 1 hr/level/day (permanent at level 5).", "ReplacementContent": "- **Tideborn Amphibious Knowledge (Nature):** Ignores underwater movement penalties and natural ocean terrain penalties. Can breathe underwater 1 hr/level/day (permanent at level 5).", "AllowMultiple": false}, {"StartLine": 43, "EndLine": 43, "TargetContent": "- **Spirit-Bound Fey (+1 Wis, +1 Cha):** Spirit Shaman evolution. Navigator Spirit manifests physically. Advantage on spirit-related checks. Ancestral Memory (advantage on History 1/day). Spirit Walk (ethereal 1 round/level, 1/day).", "ReplacementContent": "- **Spirit-Bound Fey (+1 Wis, +1 Cha):** Spirit Shaman evolution. Navigator Spirit manifests physically. Advantage on spirit-related checks. Ancestral Memory (advantage on Knowledge (History) 1/day). Spirit Walk (ethereal 1 round/level, 1/day).", "AllowMultiple": false}, {"StartLine": 44, "EndLine": 44, "TargetContent": "- **First Captain Legacy Fey (+1 Int, +1 Wis, +1 Cha):** Lost Wayfinder inheritance. Proficiency in Water Vehicles, Survival, Nature. Captain's Echo (visions from past Wayfinders). Improved Ship Bond progression. Lost Route Memory (recognize ancient routes 1/week).", "ReplacementContent": "- **First Captain Legacy Fey (+1 Int, +1 Wis, +1 Cha):** Lost Wayfinder inheritance. Proficiency in Water Vehicles, Survival, Knowledge (Nature). Captain's Echo (visions from past Wayfinders). Improved Ship Bond progression. Lost Route Memory (recognize ancient routes 1/week).", "AllowMultiple": false}], "h:\\Antigravity\\Ahoy Matey\\Wayfinder_Sourcebook\\04_The_Wayfinder_Class.md": [{"StartLine": 8, "EndLine": 8, "TargetContent": "**Proficiencies:** Choose four from Acrobatics, Arcana, Athletics, Deception, History, Insight, 